---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/main.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <header class="page-heading about-heading">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div>
        <p>
          I’m Freddie, a Year 12 student in Welwyn Garden City. I build web
          applications and run a Linux home lab to understand how software and
          infrastructure fit together.
        </p>
        <p>
          I’m interested in cybersecurity, and looking for work experience
          alongside my A-levels.
        </p>
        <a class="button cv-button" href="/cv.pdf" download>
          Download CV <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="case-section">
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div class="skill-rows">
        <div>
          <h3>Applications</h3>
          <p>
            TypeScript, React, Next.js and Git. Editing, persistence and access
            control in <a href="/projects/glyph">Glyph</a> and{' '}
            <a href="/projects/markup">Markup</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Systems</h3>
          <p>
            Linux services on Proxmox and Oracle Cloud, deployed with Docker
            Compose and Traefik in my <a href="/projects/homelab">home lab</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Networking & visibility</h3>
          <p>
            Tailscale remote access, Pi-hole DNS filtering, Wazuh log analysis,
            and Grafana and Prometheus monitoring.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Still learning</h3>
          <p>
            Python, basic PowerShell and the security decisions that connect
            application code to the systems it runs on.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="case-section">
      <h2>Education & experience</h2>
      <ol class="timeline">
        <li>
          <span>2026–2028</span>
          <div>
            <h3>A-levels</h3>
            <p>
              Year 12: Mathematics, Further Mathematics, Physics and Economics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>2026</span>
          <div>
            <h3>GCSEs & Creative iMedia</h3>
            <p>Monk’s Walk School</p>
            <dl class="results">
              <dt>Grade 8</dt>
              <dd>Mathematics, Physics, Computer Science</dd>
              <dt>Grade 7</dt>
              <dd>Biology, Chemistry, English Literature</dd>
              <dt>Grade 6</dt>
              <dd>Spanish, Art, English Language</dd>
              <dt>Level 2 Merit</dt>
              <dd>Creative iMedia</dd>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>2025</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Tesco placement</h3>
            <p>
              Software development and cybersecurity shadowing, including an
              invitation back for a dedicated cybersecurity week.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>2024</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Tesco IT operations</h3>
            <p>
              Observed infrastructure automation and incident management, and
              practised basic PowerShell scripting.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="case-section">
      <h2>Achievements</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          I earned the Duke of Edinburgh Bronze Award in 2025. My volunteering
          at a library involved helping visitors and supporting reading
          programmes.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also received the KS4 Computer Science Student of the Year award at
          Monk’s Walk School.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/certifications">
          Experience, courses & achievements
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
